The Livermore Evaluated Atomic Data Library (EADL) in the          400 1451   11
ENDF-6 Format. Translated from the Livermore ENDL format           400 1451   12
to the ENDF-6 Format by Bob MacFarlane (Los Alamos).               400 1451   13
